# 1️⃣2️⃣ Disk I/O HIGH

Suppose:

```bash
df -h
```

shows only:

```text
40% used
```

But application is extremely slow.

Then disk **space isn't the problem**.

Could be:

> Disk I/O bottleneck.

Check:

```bash
iostat
```

If available:

```bash
iostat -xz 1
```

Also:

```bash
iotop
```

This helps identify processes doing heavy disk I/O.

Another useful command:

```bash
vmstat 1
```

Mental model:

```text
Disk space ≠ Disk performance
```

