# 1️⃣9️⃣ CPU Limit Problem in Kubernetes

Suppose Java pod CPU high.

```bash
kubectl top pod
```

You see:

```text
my-java-app    950m
```

Check:

```bash
kubectl describe pod <pod>
```

and deployment:

```bash
kubectl get deployment <deployment> -o yaml
```

Maybe:

```yaml
resources:
  limits:
    cpu: "1"
```

Application needs more CPU than allocated.

Possible solutions depend on root cause:

```text
Optimize code
    OR
Increase CPU
    OR
Scale replicas
    OR
Investigate traffic
```

