# ⭐ Sabse important interview trick

Agar interviewer koi bhi problem de:

> **"Application slow hai."**

Immediately ye mat bolo:

> `restart karunga`

Instead:

### **Observe → Identify → Investigate → Fix → Verify**

```text
Observe
  ↓
What is abnormal?
  ↓
Identify
  ↓
CPU / Memory / Disk / Network / Application?
  ↓
Investigate
  ↓
Which process / thread / log / dependency?
  ↓
Fix
  ↓
Verify
  ↓
Monitor
```

**Yahi actual troubleshooting mindset hai.**

Aur ek very important distinction:

```text
CPU high     → processing problem
Memory high  → RAM/JVM/process problem
Disk full    → storage capacity problem
Disk I/O high→ read/write performance problem
Network high → connectivity/traffic problem
Application  → code/JVM/dependency problem
```

Agar tum **Linux → Java → Docker → Kubernetes** ko isi single troubleshooting chain mein samajh loge, to production troubleshooting ke bahut saare questions automatically connect ho jayenge.

